  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-244-258">ひつそり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-258-283">蝙蝠を待つてた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-283-297">草の葉は</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-297-322">夜露にぬれてた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-322-339">そつと高く</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-339-358">投げた草履</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-358-369">蝙蝠が</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-369-394">落ちたやうだぞ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-394-414">まがきの向の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-414-427">細い音</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-427-441">まがきを</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-441-469">つんとのぞいたら</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-469-481"><rb>酸</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-481-492">つぱい</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-492-513">花の香が泌みた</seg></p>
    </body>
